<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh March unemployment falls to 4.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Kazakh March unemployment falls to 4.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of people unemployed in Kazakhstan fell to 288,600 or 4.2 percent of the workforce at the end of March from 4.4 percent in February, the State Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    KAZAKH UNEMPLOYMENT	 Mar 97     Feb 97     Mar 96</p>
<p>    number unemployed	   288,600    301,800    206,000</p>
<p>    percentage of workforce	4.2	  4.4	  3.0</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
